    "created_at": "2025-07-07T17:23:46Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-07-07T17:23:46Z",
    "body": "> yep, the best thing to do meanwhile is to hide the nushell symbols and activate the fat cursor ( that helps distinguishing between modes )\n\nYeah I did that also as that should just be the default in nushell. I also just changed the nushell prompt instead of removing it.\n\n```\n❯ [N] \n❯ [I]\n```\n\nI find it ok. Though I would prefer to have it before the `❯` sign. \nI don't like Starships solution to symbolize this either. ",
